  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I created a new group and initially assumed this was just a temporary issue, so I waited for a while and refreshed the page several times. Unfortunately, nothing has changed, and I still can't access the **General Settings** for that group.\n\nTo make sure it wasn't an issue on my end, I created another test group. The new group works as expected and displays all of the available settings, including the options to edit the group name, description, and other configuration settings.\n\nHowever, the original group that I created still doesn't show any of those options. I can't edit the group name, description, or access any of the General Settings at all. It seems like the issue is only affecting that specific group, while newly created groups are working normally.",
